,"id":698746829,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5ODc0NjgyOQ==","user":{"login":"amallayev","id":61002941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDAyOTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61002941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev","html_url":"https://github.com/amallayev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallayev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-25T06:26:05Z","updated_at":"2020-09-25T06:26:05Z","body":"Hello John,\r\n\r\nI am seeking specifically the first license in the list: “License for Open-Source Software Implementations of OCB\".\r\n\r\nhttps://www.cs.ucdavis.edu/~rogaway/ocb/license1.pdf\r\n\r\nSorry for not being elaborate.\r\n\r\nAs for the usage, parts of the libgcrypt20 obtained from OCB (confirmed with version 1.8.4-5, possibly earlier) are licensed under “Open-Source Software Implementations of OCB\".\r\n\r\nSource code can be obtained here: https://www.gnupg.org/ftp/gcrypt/libgcrypt/libgcrypt-1.8.6.tar.bz2\r\nFile licensed under OCB License 1: cipher/cipher-ocb.c\r\n\r\nLet me know if further details will be needed.\r\n\r\n--\r\nBest regards,\r\nAndrian Mallayev\r\nOpen Source Compliance Program\r\n\r\nFrom: John M. Horan <notifications@github.com>\r\nSent: Friday, September 25, 2020 01:02\r\nTo: spdx/license-list-XML <license-list-XML@noreply.github.com>\r\nCc: Andrian Mallayev <amallayev@vmware.com>; Mention <mention@noreply.github.com>\r\nSubject: Re: [spdx/license-list-XML] New license request: OCB [SPDX-Online-Tools] (#1059)\r\n\r\n\r\n@amallayev<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Famallayev&data=02%7C01%7Camallayev%40vmware.com%7C9ecfb86f01d74416686808d860d580b7%7Cb39138ca3cee4b4aa4d6cd83d9dd62f0%7C0%7C0%7C637365817384831300&sdata=nGIIXi6Q7qmGx3a8vCVBOtYu9C00oQg5JbmniKaDGzE%3D&reserved=0> Thank you for your new license request. I see that the URL you provided (https://www.cs.ucdavis.edu/~rogaway/ocb/license.htm<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https:%2F%2Fwww.cs.ucdavis.edu%2F~rogaway%2Focb%2Flicense.htm&data=02%7C01%7Camallayev%40vmware.com%7C9ecfb86f01d74416686808d860d580b7%7Cb39138ca3cee4b4aa4d6cd83d9dd62f0%7C0%7C0%7C637365817384831300&sdata=eQtN%2BVl4MIzSzScdrlYHUqIanpAXAM83UUYKLV6gILg%3D&reserved=0>) lists three different licenses from Prof. Rogaway.\r\n\r\n  1.  Which of these licenses are you seeking to add to the SPDX License List?\r\n  2.  For each license you want to add, please provide several examples (with URLs) of how that license is being used.\r\n\r\n—\r\nYou are receiving this because you were mentioned.\r\nReply to this email directly, view it on GitHub<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fspdx%2Flicense-list-XML%2Fissues%2F1059%23issuecomment-698611911&data=02%7C01%7Camallayev%40vmware.com%7C9ecfb86f01d74416686808d860d580b7%7Cb39138ca3cee4b4aa4d6cd83d9dd62f0%7C0%7C0%7C637365817384831300&sdata=vT1Xhx5VAJhSx3OlpldXMhe5KT47SOLW8Rw2tbDrAdE%3D&reserved=0>, or unsubscribe<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fnotifications%2Funsubscribe-auth%2FAORNJPPSPWNDZ3IOG7HV7ZLSHO6WTANCNFSM4OPV4LIQ&data=02%7C01%7Camallayev%40vmware.com%7C9ecfb86f01d74416686808d860d580b7%7Cb39138ca3cee4b4aa4d6cd83d9dd62f0%7C0%7C0%7C637365817384841293&sdata=Lh2ag00hGLyBw4uo7lXnk6AS4PlIX4%2FlYY810qJ3oGQ%