ht license grant.  If that is indeed the case, this license may not be suitable for inclusion on the SPDX license list.  @swinslow  @jlovejoy What do you think?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/703741432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/714628174","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1059#issuecomment-714628174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1059","id":714628174,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNDYyODE3NA==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-22T16:57:47Z","updated_at":"2020-10-22T17:00:59Z","body":"so, seems like the example is really LGPL-2.1-or-later, plus this specific patent grant/license? In which case, it would reviewed as entirely new license addition and it fails re-usability factor as it's